key-cast-placement

From: Victor Araújo <victor@victor-software-house.com>

Downstream-Reason: Let a tape size the key overlay with Set KeyCastScale and lift it off the bottom rows with Set KeyCastRise; unset, it draws as before.
Upstream-Status: not-submitted
Drop-When: Upstream evp lets a tape size and place its key overlay.
